          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>The entry point to the NB2 range, taking GVM to 5500 KG on a modest two inch lift.</em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM:</strong> 5500 KG | <strong>GCM:</strong> 12,750 KG | <strong>Braked Towing:</strong> 4500 KG</li><li><strong>Payload:</strong> 1740 KG, up 96% on the factory 886 KG</li><li><strong>Lift &amp; Tyres:</strong> 2\" lift, running up to 35x12.5 R18 or 35x12.5 R20.</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> Fox 2.5 Performance Series HTO shocks front and rear, Husky Extenda flares colour coded to your vehicle, ORI mud flap brackets.</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Daily drivers and light tourers who want real payload headroom without the biggest lift.</li><li><strong>Kit Number:</strong> RAM6-2500-Stage1-GVM</li></ul>"
